        "pinned_at": "2026-09-23"
      },
      "notes": "No LICENSE file. The GPU energy-distance pipeline the IGVF TF Perturb-seq consortium runs (step 0 PCA + guide dictionary; step 1 outlier guides via DISCO, hypergeometric ranking and K-means on non-targeting guides; step 2 per-target energy distance vs num_bg random non-targeting backgrounds with permutation p-values -> pval_edist_full.csv). IGVFagent's tf-perturb edist-prep / edist-filter / edist re-derive the statistics on CPU with numpy/scipy (E = 2*mean cross - within - within; pval_mean_log = -log10(pval_mean + 0.1/(perm*bg))) and write the same column schema, defaults num_bg 20, permutations 1000, non_target_pick 2000, target max 2000. For 10^5-cell screens run the upstream container and hand its folder to edist-validate / edist-summary."
    },
